<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 6,480.41 pts.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 6,480.41 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange rallied 2.65 percent on Wednesday to a new record close of 6,480.41 points, up 167.23, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 8.726 billion forints.</p>
</text>
